# PERFORM (HOME 2nd press, wip695): K4 = ALL FX on / off (reverb, delay, distortion, filter; never a compressor). Right = all effects active (default), left = all off (dry signal). Not saved, no SAVE mark.
wait 300
tap HOME
tap HOME
expect view 2
expect fxpage 0
expect fxoff 0
shot fxall_on.png
turn K4 -1 80
expect fxoff 1
shot fxall_off.png
turn K4 1 80
expect fxoff 0
turn K4 -1 80
tap HOME
expect fxoff 1
tap SEQ
expect fxoff 1
# PERFORM footer (wip118): BLACK: MUTE / WHITE: NEXT PAT / AGAIN: NEXT PAGE
tap HOME
tap HOME
shot perf_footer.png
